  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "3792bc71-1332-4cef-99dc-8addf2c355d8"],
 "\[LineSeparator]",
 "draws a transverse light clock carried by the observer of velocity ",
 StyleBox["v", "TI"],
 ", with ",
 StyleBox["n", "TI"],
 " bounces between the observer and a mirror.",
 "\n",
 Cell["   ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->"2968ca44-dd77-4005-b8ec-020ac86543c9"],
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   TemplateBox[{
